    "warnings": [
      "The automation account says every Lean claim passed GitHub Actions on exact pull-request heads and merged main, but the S176 record says those checks were still pending for the Palomar statement package. This overstates the package’s verification history. Distinguish the earlier C4 theorem’s completed PR and merged-main checks from the package’s local Comparator check and the recorded Palomar mechanical check.",
      "The literature account omits Lanari–Scoccola’s earlier quantitative homotopy-interleaving separation for spaces and its explicit discussion of the homotopy-versus-derived comparison. The repository’s own source-inspection record identifies both as directly relevant predecessors, though not as proofs of this C₄ result. Their omission obscures how the selected separation relates to prior work. Add that comparison and distinguish the earlier spaces result from the present chain-complex example."
